SUMMARY:Fit4Mom Yoga & Wine Night
DESCRIPTION:🧘‍♀️🍷 Yoga & Wine at the Vineyard 🍷🧘‍♂️\n📅 Second Wednesday of Each Month | 6:00–8:00PM\n✨ May 13 | 6–8pm ✨\nBack by popular demand\, FIT4MOM Davis-Woodland and Great Bear Vineyards are teaming up once again for the ultimate midweek reset—yoga\, wine\, and vineyard vibes. 🌿🌅\nUnroll your mat and enjoy an easy to moderate Vinyasa flow led by the talented FIT4MOM Davis-Woodland instructors. Set to groovy tunes and tailored to your skill level\, this class is perfect whether you’re a seasoned yogi or just getting started.\nAs practice winds down\, you’ll be guided through an original inspirational meditation before settling in to enjoy a glass of delicious Great Bear wine.\n🎟 Ticket Includes:\n🧘 Yoga Class\n🍷 First Glass of Wine\nAfter class\, linger a little longer—take a stroll through the lavender fields\, set up a picnic\, or relax and socialize with new and old friends.\n✨ A workout and wine are the stuff summer dreams are made of.\n🎒 What to Bring:\n• Yoga mat\n• Towel\n• Water\n• Money/card for an extra glass or bottle of wine\n• Picnic snacks or dinner items\n• Light jacket or sweater\n📍 Organizer: FIT4MOM Davis-Woodland\nWe can’t wait to flow\, sip\, and unwind with you under the evening sky!
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/fit4mom-yoga-wine-night/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards (Great Bear)\, 24800 County Rd 101A
CATEGORIES:Fitness,Food & Drink
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Fit4Mom-Yoga-Night-Thumbnail.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
GEO:38.5818013;-121.7499687
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Great Bear Vineyards (Great Bear) 24800 County Rd 101A;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=24800 County Rd 101A:geo:-121.7499687,38.5818013
END:VEVENT
